## Scope

Implemented the measurement-driven automatic Compiled Native analyzer in the isolated v2.4 surface. The pipeline accepts HTML/HTM/ZIP, collects the applicable CSS universe, measures the sanitized source in a script-disabled browser, detects Header/Section/Footer boundaries, classifies dynamic Stack/Flex/Grid layouts per viewport, preserves computed box-model evidence, maps only layout structure to existing v2.4 node shapes, and reports source-vs-target deltas.

The analyzer does not choose widgets automatically, does not use Exact Visual or recommendation fallbacks, and does not silently save or replace the Canvas tree. After analysis, the wizard requires an explicit widget choice for every mapped source block, builds a draft target, validates structural evidence, and only then supports an explicit in-memory Apply to Canvas; the normal Save action remains separate. The flow does not modify v2.3 or the main responsive engine.

