## Normalized visual mapping extension — 2026-08-30

The mapping stage now consumes a recursive normalized visual projection rather than presenting every measured DOM element as an independent flat source block. Raw measured nodes remain intact with source IDs, parent relationships, attributes, HTML, computed styles, rectangles, and viewport evidence. Normalized nodes expose `mappingRoots`, `childMappingIds`, `memberSourceIds`, `mappingRole`, `mappingKind`, and deterministic widget candidates.

Nested structural `div` elements are retained when they establish Grid/Flex or a distinct visual boundary. Layout-neutral wrappers are promoted without dropping their content. Semantic text with inline descendants stays one mapping unit, while `span`, `br`, and decorative `i` remain expandable members. The projection recognizes composite shapes such as `div > dt(icon/label) + dd(value)` as `icon_box`, `figure > img + overlay` as `image_box` with retained members, and thin textless visual rules as `divider`. Structural Grid/Flex evidence wins over composite heuristics, so media or icons inside a layout wrapper do not collapse the wrapper into a widget.

On the real source replay (`E:\Apps\Laragon\www\ceo-masters\index.html`), Section 1 reduced from 38 raw nodes to 18 normalized mapping nodes. Its root is the measured two-column Grid (`node-33`), with a left Container (`node-34`), CTA Container (`node-42`), Button candidates (`node-46`, `node-47`), Icon Box candidates (`node-50`, `node-51`, `node-52`), Divider (`node-37`), and Image Box candidate (`node-62`). High-confidence candidates prefill the widget select; the user-selected value remains editable and is the only value consumed by target compilation.

Current extension verification: **67 PHPUnit tests passed with 345 assertions**, **414 Node tests passed with 0 failures**, Vue template compilation passed, 18 scoped PHP files passed lint, `git diff --check` passed, and Graphify was refreshed to **21,074 nodes / 38,885 links** with the normalized controller → classifier → mapper path query confirmed. Chrome read-only reload showed the editor root and Compiled Native entry point after the prior blank-screen fix; no new error was observed after reload.

The normalized layer does not claim pixel parity from a candidate score. Overlay composites may still need an explicit choice between a composite widget and an expanded Container/Image/overlay structure, and local package assets still need persistent asset mapping before Apply. The unrelated 419 CSRF baseline remains out of scope. No Save or Apply action was executed.

